    "theorem": "CycleCouplingAudit.cycle_coupling_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem cycle_coupling_certificate : (fairCoin false = (2 : ENNReal)⁻¹ ∧ fairCoin true = (2 : ENNReal)⁻¹) ∧ (∀ (n : ℕ) [NeZero n] (t : ℕ) (f : ZMod n → ℝ) (x : ZMod n), expectation (fairLaw walkStep t x) f = average walkStep t f x) ∧ (∀ (n : ℕ) [NeZero n] (t : ℕ) (f : ZMod n → ℝ) (x y : ZMod n), average coupleStep t (fun s => f s.1) (x,y) = average walkStep t f x ∧ average coupleStep t (fun s => f s.2) (x,y) = average walkStep t f y) ∧ (∀ (n : ℕ) [NeZero n], 2 ≤ n → ∀ s : ZMod n × ZMod n, (pairPotential (coupleStep false s) + pairPotential (coupleStep true s))/2 = pairPotential s - mismatch s) ∧ (∀ (n : ℕ) [NeZero n], 2 ≤ n → ∀ t : ℕ, 0 < t → ∀ (x : ZMod n) (A : Finset (ZMod n)), abs (walkProbability t x A - (A.card : ℝ)/n) ≤ (n : ℝ)^2/(4*t)) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (a b : ZMod p), a ≠ b → ∀ t : ℕ, 0 < t → ∀ (x : ZMod p) (A : Finset (ZMod p)), abs (twoProbability a b t x A - (A.card : ℝ)/p) ≤ (p : ℝ)^2/(4*t)) ∧ (∀ t : ℕ, abs (expectation (fairLaw deterministicStep t (0 : ZMod 2)) (eventIndicator {(t : ZMod 2)}) - (1 : ℝ)/2) = 1/2) ∧ (¬ ∃ T : ℕ, ∀ t : ℕ, T ≤ t → abs (expectation (fairLaw deterministicStep t (0 : ZMod 2)) (eventIndicator {(t : ZMod 2)}) - (1 : ℝ)/2) ≤ 1/4) ∧ (¬ abs (walkProbability 0 (0 : ZMod 2) {0} - (1 : ℝ)/2) ≤ (2 : ℝ)^2/(4*0))",
    "decl_sha256": "dbd609ef808defc71765389c4746628d85d20739fc39bec056a270e1855631f0",
    "scope": "Actual independent-increment fairBool PMF/map/bind walk on every ZModn n>=2: exact real-expectation binding, explicit coalescent two-particle kernel, both marginal expectations, disagreement monotonicity, exact drift of actual potential val(d)*(n-val(d)), and uniform stationarity yield paper-normalized event distance <= n²/(4t) for everyt>0/start/event. Any primefield and two distinct equalweight increments inherit p²/(4t) by proved time-dependent affine permutation, not static conjugacy. Actual deterministic increment walk onZMod2 has eventdistance1/2 at everytime and direct eventual-mixing negation; zero-time extension refuted. Qualified Hildebrand1994 k2/equalweight case progress; generalweights/k>=3/randomsupport and staticrho/collision asymptotics notproved/refuted. Credited LPW coupling method and selectedprimary scopes, no novelty/fullprimary/full14closure. Standardfoundations/defaultlimits/noholes/customaxioms/nativeeval/raisedlimits/newglobalflags/waivers/nativeexperiment/paidcompute/upload.",
